{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/uicomponentsreference"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The UI product layers three view modifiers on top of ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Two primitives present the paywall and customer center directly from a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Binding<Bool>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; one convenience modifier composes both, driven by ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Each presentation modifier attaches to the modified content view directly — there are no ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" wrappers and no ","type":"text"},{"code":".background { … }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" indirection. This shape is what makes the macOS sheet machinery present reliably.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For step-by-step wiring, see ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How to Present the UI"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" documentation. For the rationale behind platform-specific behavior, see ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Platform Behavior"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in the same catalog.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Library-target","level":2,"text":"Library target","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Product: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Import: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":[".product(name: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\", package: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\"),"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The UI product depends on ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", both pulled in transitively. Apps that don’t ship paywall UI in the same target (for example, a tests-only target) can depend on the lower-level ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" product alone.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Modifiers","level":2,"text":"Modifiers","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"revenueCatPaywallisPresentedofferingIdentifierdisplayCloseButtonfontspresentationStylepurchaseLogiconEventonDismiss","level":3,"text":"`revenueCatPaywall(isPresented:offeringIdentifier:displayCloseButton:fonts:presentationStyle:purchaseLogic:onEvent:onDismiss:)`","type":"heading"},{"code":["extension View {","    public func revenueCatPaywall(","        isPresented: Binding<Bool>,","        offeringIdentifier: String? = nil,","        displayCloseButton: Bool = true,","        fonts: any PaywallFontProvider = DefaultPaywallFontProvider(),","        presentationStyle: RevenueCatPaywallPresentationStyle = .automatic,","        purchaseLogic: RevenueCatPaywallPurchaseLogic? = nil,","        onEvent: RevenueCatPaywallEventHandler? = nil,","        onDismiss: (() -> Void)? = nil","    ) -> some View","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Attaches ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatUI.PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as a platform-appropriate sheet.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — The automatic style uses a full-screen cover at compact width and a sheet at regular width.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Presents in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sheet"},{"text":" sized to a 400×600 minimum.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass a real two-way binding; SwiftUI sets it to ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on user dismissal. Build it from ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState.isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so the ","type":"text"},{"code":"set:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" closure dispatches ","type":"text"},{"code":".paywall(.dismiss)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the plugin clears its presentation state.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Parameters","level":4,"text":"Parameters","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPresented"},{"text":" — Two-way binding to the paywall’s visibility flag.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offeringIdentifier"},{"text":" — Identifier of the RevenueCat offering to present, for a win-back or regional offer. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", which presents the dashboard’s current offering. An unknown identifier asserts in Debug and falls back to the current offering with a logged warning; a fetch failure also falls back without asserting.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"displayCloseButton"},{"text":" — Whether ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"text":" shows a close button. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":". When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", iOS sheets disable interactive dismissal. On macOS, Escape dismisses only when this is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fonts"},{"text":" — RevenueCatUI font provider used by every resolved paywall.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentationStyle"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".automatic"},{"text":" adapts to iOS width and uses a sheet on macOS. iOS callers can force ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".sheet"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".fullScreen"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"purchaseLogic"},{"text":" — App-owned StoreKit 2 purchase and restore operations for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"purchasesAreCompletedBy: .myApp"},{"text":". Leave ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" when RevenueCat completes purchases.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEvent"},{"text":" — Optional callback for package-owned purchase, restore, cancellation, purchase-failure, and restore-failure values. It exposes Foundation identifiers and error fields instead of RevenueCat models.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"text":" — Optional callback fired after dismissal.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dashboard exit offers do not run through these modifiers. RevenueCatUI implements them in its own ","type":"text"},{"code":"presentPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifiers, which always add a close button; using that path here would change ","type":"text"},{"code":"displayCloseButton: false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from a hard paywall into a dismissible one. Apps that need exit offers should use RevenueCatUI’s presenter directly.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"revenueCatCustomerCenterisPresentedonDismiss","level":3,"text":"`revenueCatCustomerCenter(isPresented:onDismiss:)`","type":"heading"},{"code":["extension View {","    public func revenueCatCustomerCenter(","        isPresented: Binding<Bool>,","        onDismiss: (() -> Void)? = nil","    ) -> some View","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Attaches the customer center as a platform-appropriate sheet.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Presents ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatUI.CustomerCenterView"},{"text":" in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sheet"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Opens ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"itms-apps:\/\/apps.apple.com\/account\/subscriptions"},{"text":" through SwiftUI’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openURL"},{"text":" environment action (falling back to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/apps.apple.com\/account\/subscriptions"},{"text":" web URL if nothing handles the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"itms-apps"},{"text":" scheme), immediately clears the binding, and fires ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"text":". RevenueCatUI does not ship a customer center on macOS.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Parameters","level":4,"text":"Parameters","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPresented"},{"text":" — Two-way binding to the customer center’s visibility flag.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"text":" — Optional callback fired after dismissal (or, on macOS, after the App Store URL is opened).","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenterstateofferingIdentifierdisplayCloseButtonfontspresentationStylepurchaseLogiconEventonAction","level":3,"text":"`revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter(state:offeringIdentifier:displayCloseButton:fonts:presentationStyle:purchaseLogic:onEvent:onAction:)`","type":"heading"},{"code":["extension View {","    public func revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter(","        state: PaywallState,","        offeringIdentifier: String? = nil,","        displayCloseButton: Bool = true,","        fonts: any PaywallFontProvider = DefaultPaywallFontProvider(),","        presentationStyle: RevenueCatPaywallPresentationStyle = .automatic,","        purchaseLogic: RevenueCatPaywallPurchaseLogic? = nil,","        onEvent: RevenueCatPaywallEventHandler? = nil,","        onAction: @escaping (PaywallAction) -> Void","    ) -> some View","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Convenience modifier that attaches both primitive presentation surfaces and dispatches the matching actions through ","type":"text"},{"code":"onAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On iOS the two presentations are mutually exclusive and the paywall wins. On macOS a customer-center request dispatches ","type":"text"},{"code":".openManageSubscriptions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" through the paywall plugin, then ","type":"text"},{"code":".dismissCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; the external App Store hand-off remains available while the paywall sheet is open. After a restore inside the paywall, the modifier also dispatches ","type":"text"},{"code":".dismiss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once ","type":"text"},{"code":"state.isGateSatisfied","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", because RevenueCatUI does not dismiss after a restore. Attach the modifier once to one app-wide presentation host. See ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Platform Behavior"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" documentation.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Parameters","level":4,"text":"Parameters","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"text":" — The paywall slice from your store, typically ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.paywall"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offeringIdentifier"},{"text":" — Identifier of the RevenueCat offering to present. When it is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state.requestedReason"},{"text":" is used as a RevenueCat placement identifier. For an unknown placement, RevenueCat may return the dashboard’s placement fallback offering, which can differ from the current offering; the package uses the current offering when RevenueCat returns no placement fallback. An explicit identifier takes precedence.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"displayCloseButton"},{"text":" — Whether ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"text":" shows a close button. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":"; see the primitive modifier above.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"fonts","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — RevenueCatUI font provider used by the paywall."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentationStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" — Automatic or explicit iOS presentation style; macOS always uses a sheet."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"purchaseLogic","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — App-owned StoreKit 2 purchase and restore operations for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"purchasesAreCompletedBy: .myApp"},{"type":"text","text":". Leave "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" when RevenueCat completes purchases."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"onEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Optional package-owned outcome callback; see the primitive modifier above.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"onAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — A closure that lifts a ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into your root action and dispatches it through the store. Typically ","type":"text"},{"code":"{ store.send(.paywall($0)) }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Manual-wiring","level":4,"text":"Manual wiring","type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["ContentView()","    .revenueCatPaywall(","        isPresented: Binding(","            get: { store.paywall.isPresented },","            set: { if !$0 { store.send(.paywall(.dismiss)) } }","        )","    )","    .revenueCatCustomerCenter(","        isPresented: Binding(","            get: { store.paywall.isCustomerCenterPresented },","            set: { if !$0 { store.send(.paywall(.dismissCustomerCenter)) } }","        )","    )"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This attaches the same presentation surfaces but leaves the iOS exclusivity and close-after-restore rules to the app. Use the convenience modifier when both surfaces are needed; use the primitives when only one is needed or when you want to interleave other modifiers between them.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/UIComponentsReference","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"API reference for the paywall, customer-center, and composed view modifiers in ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"UI Components Reference","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"role":"article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/PlatformBehavior"],"title":"Related Documentation","anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockServiceReference"],"title":"Reference","anchor":"Reference"}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall":{"title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s "},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Implements "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" against "},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with "},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for drop-in "},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" presentation."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/MockServiceReference":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockServiceReference","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/mockservicereference","title":"Mock Service Reference","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for ","type":"text"},{"code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a controllable ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformer for previews and tests that does not touch ","type":"text"},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPresentTheUI":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","abstract":[{"text":"Attach ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter"},{"text":" from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"text":" to a root view to present both surfaces from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallState"},{"text":", or attach either binding-driven primitive by itself.","type":"text"}],"title":"How to Present the UI","role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopresenttheui"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/PlatformBehavior":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Platform Behavior","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/PlatformBehavior","abstract":[{"text":"How the paywall and customer-center modifiers choose presentation, and which controls remain fixed.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/platformbehavior","role":"article"},"doc://Swid